Bundled Hunspell libraries
==========================

The static Microsoft Visual C++ libraries in ``libs/msvc`` are bundled because
Windows wheels link Hunspell statically. The corresponding Hunspell licensing
terms are included in ``HUNSPELL_LICENSE_LESSER``.

Linux and macOS builds download and compile Hunspell 1.7.2 during the native
extension build.

To replace the Windows libraries, build Hunspell 1.7.2 in Release mode for x64
and Win32 with the ``/MD`` runtime, then copy the resulting ``libhunspell.lib``
files to:

* ``libs/msvc/libhunspell-msvc14-x64.lib``
* ``libs/msvc/libhunspell-msvc14-x86.lib``

When the standard Hunspell Visual Studio output paths are present under
``external/hunspell-1.7.2``, ``libs/copy_msvc_libs.sh`` performs those copies.
